WEBVTT

00:02:55.746 --> 00:03:00.038
And honestly, I found it really quite
exciting to hear Sam's vision

00:03:00.288 --> 00:03:04.413
for where all this could lead. OK,
let's do this.

00:03:16.246 --> 00:03:17.996
So, Sam Altman, welcome.

00:03:18.579 --> 00:03:19.579
Thank you for having me.

00:03:20.871 --> 00:03:23.871
So, Sam, here we are in 2021.

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:26.371
A lot of people are fearful of

00:03:26.371 --> 00:03:28.371
the future at this moment
in world history.

00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:30.704
How would you describe your
attitude to the future?